      },
      "output_contract": {
        "shared_intro": "共享四层 schema 的字段含义以 [verdict 字段说明](../references/verdict-schema.md) 为准；Munger 只补自己独有的 root key、native verdict 和 `seat_specific` 约束。",
        "sections": [
          {
            "root_key": "munger_verdict",
            "phase": "1",
            "extra_route_lines": [
              "若 must_haves 本身是 Goodhart / 激励扭曲 / 样本污染，应走 `revise_must_haves`"
            ],
